  "finalNarrative": {
    "headline": {
      "text": "Learning, support and absorption take first emphasis",
      "factRefs": [
        "S02_PERSONALITY:PRIMARY"
      ],
      "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
      "operator": "RANK_PRESERVING_SUMMARY",
      "relationType": "EMPHASIS"
    },
    "lead": {
      "text": "Learning, support and absorption are the main reading priority here. This priority is not a measurement of your personality or ability.",
      "factRefs": [
        "S02_PERSONALITY:PRIMARY"
      ],
      "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
      "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
      "relationType": "EMPHASIS"
    },
    "closingInsight": {
      "text": "Absorbing, practicing, expressing and carrying something consistently are considered together as simultaneous dimensions, not as a sequence.",
      "factRefs": [
        "S02_PERSONALITY:DIMENSIONS"
      ],
      "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
      "operator": "PLAIN_LANGUAGE_ABSTRACTION",
      "relationType": "CO_OCCURRING_DIMENSIONS"
    },
    "technicalNote": {
      "text": "",
      "factRefs": [],
      "kind": "TECHNICAL_NOTE",
      "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
      "relationType": "BOUNDARY"
    },
    "boundaryNote": {
      "text": "This is a conditional symbolic reading, not a statement about observed behavior or a prediction of events.",
      "factRefs": [
        "S02_PERSONALITY:BOUNDARY"
      ],
      "kind": "BOUNDARY",
      "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
      "relationType": "BOUNDARY"
    },
    "interpretation": [
      {
        "text": "Capability is considered through four dimensions at once: what can be absorbed, practiced, expressed and carried consistently.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:DIMENSIONS"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
        "relationType": "CO_OCCURRING_DIMENSIONS"
      },
      {
        "text": "Peer relationships and self-position, along with rules, responsibility and pressure, are secondary associated themes; they do not replace the first emphasis.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:SECONDARY"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "RANK_PRESERVING_SUMMARY",
        "relationType": "ASSOCIATION"
      },
      {
        "text": "The structural link between self-position and expression forms part of the reading context.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:PAIR_BAZI-CX-PRO-W5-REL-01"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
        "relationType": "CONTEXT_MODIFIER"
      },
      {
        "text": "Separately, the structural tension between environment and self-position also forms part of the reading context.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:PAIR_BAZI-CX-PRO-W5-REL-02"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
        "relationType": "CONTEXT_MODIFIER"
      },
      {
        "text": "A final strong-or-weak judgment remains open and should not be treated as a fixed identity.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:OPEN_STRENGTH"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "PARAPHRASE",
        "relationType": "OPEN_CONDITION"
      }
    ],
    "supportingConditions": [],
    "tensionConditions": [
      {
        "text": "Support, expression and external demands need to be considered together, while how they are experienced remains undetermined.",
        "factRefs": [
          "S02_PERSONALITY:TENSION"
        ],
        "kind": "CUSTOMER_CLAIM",
        "operator": "CONDITIONAL_REFRAME",
        "relationType": "TENSION"
      }
    ],
